ALFRA Rotabest™ RB50SP metal cutting, permanent magnet base drill is revolutionizing the industry. Our rare earth magnet, in conjunction with our LED sensor ensures the safety of the user. Even if the power is cut, our magnet will stay actuated. Our three level notification sensor system notifies the user when the machine is close to lift off and will shut the motor down if lift-off is achieved. In addition, it offers variable height adjustment, a smooth start and overload protection. With the use of a drill chuck adaptor, this unit can hold a drill bit with a maximum of 1/2".";s:14:"specifications";s:557:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Technical Data","value":"Max Ø of cutter|Max cutting Depth|Material Thickness|Twist Drill Ø max|Counterbore|Tapping|Arbor|Stroke|Height Adjustment|2-speed Gearbox on-load speed\no 1st speed\no 2nd speed|• Input|• Voltage|• Tool Force (10mm)|• Size of magnet foot|• Weight"},{"label":"Column 2","value":"Ø 12 - 50 mm|50 mm|minimum of 3 mm|Ø 1.0 – 20.0 mm DIN 1897 Short|Ø 10 - 40 mm|M3 – M20|MT2|80 mm|80 mm|250 rpm\n450 rpm|1,200W|230V 50/60Hz|2,300 N|72 mm x 190 mm|11.5 kgs."}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:111:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_50_sp_20260406_072253_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:56:59.968801+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:14:"sp-line-series";s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:111:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_50_sp_20260406_072253_0.jpg";i:1;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_50_sp_2_20260406_072254_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:110:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/rb_50sp_drill_20260406_072255.pdf";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15641;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"drilling-and-lifting";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:14:"magnetic-drill";s:5:"brand";s:5:"Alfra";s:12:"product_name";s:15:"Prod.-No. 18710";s:5:"model";s:49:"Rotabest V32 Low Profile Magnetic Base Core Drill";s:4:"type";s:19:"Magnetic Core Drill";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:682:"Overview
•        Horizontal Metal Core Drilling Machine for the pokiest spaces. Perfect to use, where regular Metal Core Drilling Machines have to quit due to their height.
•        The total height is just 227 mm and can even be reduced to 185 mm by removing the handle. 
•        The spur gear unit is designed for an industrial use and the down feed is carried out by means of a ratchet lever. Switchable from right to left hand operation. 
•        Another advantage: the design of the angled gear unit ensures a permanent lubrication and avoids a dry running. 
