Minimum weight, maximum power - that is what the ALFRA RB 35/50 X Piccolo is standing for. Our small one has a dead weight of only 11.5 kg and is scoring in terms of efficiency, service life, user-friendliness and occupational safety. The compact power pack can be combined with core drills with a diameter of up to 35 mm, with step drills up to a diameter of 40 mm and with twist drills up to a diameter of 13 mm. More advantages for you: the time-saving quick-change holder, 10000 N magnetic holding force for a stable working position and an LED sensor to check if the material thickness is sufficient. In addition, it has, among other things, a continuously adjustable carriage with self-adjusting guide, a user-friendly foil keyboard, a comfortable 5-meter cable and soft-touch handles.";s:14:"specifications";s:521:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Technical Data","value":"Max Ø of cutter|Max cutting Depth|Material Thickness|Twist Drill Ø max|Countersinking|Arbor|Stroke|Motor adjustable in height|Gear box on-load speed|Input|Voltage|Tool Force (10mm)|Magnet adhesion|Size of magnet foot|Weight"},{"label":"Column 2","value":"Ø 12 – 35 mm|50 mm|minimum of 6 mm|Ø 1.0 – 13.0 mm|Ø 10.0 – 40.0 mm|Quick-release chuck|129mm|86mm|450 rpm|1,100W|230V 50/60Hz|2,100 N|10,000 N|70 mm x 185 mm|15.0 kgs."}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb35_50_x_piccolo_20260406_071846_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:56:59.968801+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:15:"rbx-line-series";s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb35_50_x_piccolo_20260406_071846_0.jpg";i:1;s:124:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb35_50_x_piccolo_-_2_20260406_071847_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:115:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/rb_35-50_x_piccolo_20260406_071848.pdf";}i:6;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15646;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"drilling-and-lifting";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:14:"magnetic-drill";s:5:"brand";s:5:"Alfra";s:12:"product_name";s:15:"Prod.-No. 18751";s:5:"model";s:39:"Rotabest RB50X Magnetic Base Core Drill";s:4:"type";s:19:"Magnetic Core Drill";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:308:"Overview
