ALFRA Rotabest™ RB35SP metal cutting, permanent magnet base drill is revolutionizing the industry. Our rare earth magnet, in conjunction with our LED sensor ensures the safety of the user. Even if the power is cut, our magnet will stay actuated. Our three level notification sensor system notifies the user when the machine is close to lift off and will shut the motor down if lift-off is achieved. In addition, it offers variable height adjustment, a smooth start and overload protection. With the use of a drill chuck adaptor, this unit can hold a drill bit with a maximum of 1/2".";s:14:"specifications";s:489:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Technical Data","value":"Max Ø of cutter|Max cutting Depth|Material Thickness|Twist Drill Ø max|Countersinking|Arbor|Stroke|Height Adjustment|Gearbox on-load speed|Input|Voltage|Tool Force (10mm)|Size of magnet foot|Weight"},{"label":"Column 2","value":"Ø 12 - 35 mm|50 mm|minimum of 3 mm|Ø 1.0 – 13.0 mm DIN 1897 Short|Yes|Quick-change tool-holder|105 mm|80 mm|450 rpm|1,100W|230V 50/60Hz|2,800 N|72 mm x 190 mm|9.9 kgs."}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:111:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_35_sp_20260406_072133_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:56:59.968801+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:14:"sp-line-series";s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:111:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_35_sp_20260406_072133_0.jpg";i:1;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/rb_35_sp_2_20260406_072134_1.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:110:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/rb_35sp_drill_20260406_072135.pdf";}i:8;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15648;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"drilling-and-lifting";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:14:"magnetic-drill";s:5:"brand";s:5:"Alfra";s:12:"product_name";s:15:"Prod.-No. 18700";s:5:"model";s:39:"Rotabest RB35X Magnetic Base Core Dr