•        Good level of grip in dry and slightly oily environments";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/edge_48-128_-_1_20260406_080914_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:12:02.545874+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:14:"working-gloves";s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/edge_48-128_-_1_20260406_080914_0.png";i:1;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/edge_48-128_-_2_20260406_080915_1.png";i:2;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/edge_48-128_-_3_20260406_080915_2.jpg";i:3;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/edge_48-128_-_4_20260406_080916_3.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/edge-48-128_datasheet_20260406_080917.pdf";}}}s:7:"Aquasol";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15655;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:6:"others";s:5:"brand";s:7:"Aquasol";s:12:"product_name";s:29:"Water Soluble Paper and Tapes";s:5:"model";s:41:"Dissolvable Purge Barrier for TIG Welding";s:4:"type";s:31:"Welding Accessories Consumables";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1602:"Aquasol® Water Soluble Paper and Tape offer a highly effective, biodegradable solution for creating custom purge dams used in TIG welding of stainless steel and aluminum pipes. Designed to retain noble gases such as argon and helium close to the weld zone, this versatile system improves purge efficiency, reduces gas consumption, and simplifies preparation and cleanup. Made of water-soluble materials that dissolve completely during hydro testing, it leaves no residue behind. 

Key Features & Benefits:
Effective Purge Gas Barrier
•        Creates a low air-permeable barrier to retain inert gases during welding. 
•        Customizable construction for use with various pipe diameters and schedules. 
•        Reduces purge gas consumption by enabling positioning close to the weld zone. 
•        Secures tightly to the pipe’s inner wall using water-soluble tape for airtight sealing. 
Biodegradable & Safe
•        Manufactured from sodium carboxy methyl cellulose and wooden pulp — 100% biodegradable. 
•        EPA and CE approved material, non-toxic and environmentally friendly. 
•        Accepted by industries such as nuclear, petrochemical, and food & beverage. 
Easy Removal
•        Dissolves rapidly and completely in water or steam, leaving no residue in the pipeline. 
•        Simplifies post-weld cleanup and transitions into hydro testing. 
Convenient & Versatile
•        Individually packaged paper rolls for simple storage and handling. 
•        Available in a wide range of sizes, grades, and forms to accommodate any pipe diameter.";s:14:"specifications";s:1845:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Item No</th><th>Thickness</th><th>Dimensions</th><th>Type</th><th>Case Pack</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ASW-35/S-22R</td><td>0.0035″ (0.088 mm)</td><td>17″ × 22″ (431 × 559 mm)</td><td>Sheet</td><td>500 sheets/ream</td></tr><tr><td>ASW-35/R-15</td><td>0.0035″ (0.088 mm)</td><td>15½″ × 165′ (39 × 50 m)</td><td>Roll</td><td>4 rolls/case</td></tr><tr><td>ASW-60/S-22R</td><td>0.0070″ (0.177 mm)</td><td>15½″ × 22″ (394 × 559 mm)</td><td>Sheet</td><td>250 sheets/ream</td></tr><tr><td>ASW-60/R-15</td><td>0.0070″ (0.177 mm)</td><td>15½″ × 165′ (39 × 50 m)</td><td>Roll</td><td>4 rolls/case</td></tr><tr><td>ASW-60/R-31</td><td>0.0070″ (0.177 mm)</td><td>31″ × 165′ (79 × 50 m)</td><td>Roll</td><td>4 rolls/case</td></tr><tr><td>ASWT-1</td><td>N/A</td><td>1″ × 300′ (2.5 × 92 m)</td><td>Tape Roll</td><td>24 rolls/case</td></tr><tr><td>ASWT-2</td><td>N/A</td><td>2″ × 300′ (5 × 92 m)</td><td>Tape Roll</td><td>12 rolls/case</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Item No","Thickness","Dimensions","Type","Case Pack"],"rows":[["ASW-35/S-22R","0.0035″ (0.088 mm)","17″ × 22″ (431 × 559 mm)","Sheet","500 sheets/ream"],["ASW-35/R-15","0.0035″ (0.088 mm)","15½″ × 165′ (39 × 50 m)","Roll","4 rolls/case"],["ASW-60/S-22R","0.0070″ (0.177 mm)","15½″ × 22″ (394 × 559 mm)","Sheet","250 sheets/ream"],["ASW-60/R-15","0.0070″ (0.177 mm)","15½″ × 165′ (39 × 50 m)","Roll","4 rolls/case"],["ASW-60/R-31","0.0070″ (0.177 mm)","31″ × 165′ (79 × 50 m)","Roll","4 rolls/case"],["ASWT-1","N/A","1″ × 300′ (2.5 × 92 m)","Tape Roll","24 rolls/case"],["ASWT-2","N/A","2″ × 300′ (5 × 92 m)","Tape Roll","12 rolls/case"]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aquasol_1_20260406_093001_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T07:30:04.860185+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aquasol_1_20260406_093001_0.jpg";i:1;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aquasol_2_20260406_093002_1.jpg";i:2;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aquasol_3_20260406_093002_2.jpg";i:3;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aquasol_4_20260406_093003_3.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:6:"Arcair";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15656;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"arc-welding-machine";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:27:"accessories-and-consumables";s:5:"brand";s:6:"Arcair";s:12:"product_name";s:5:"K4000";s:5:"model";s:13:"Gouging Torch";s:4:"type";s:19:"Welding Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:750:"The Professional Arcair® K4000 is a heavy-duty air carbon arc gouging torch designed for efficient metal removal and weld preparation in demanding fabrication environments such as shipyards, structural steel plants, and pressure vessel shops. Built for rugged performance, it features an optimized air flow head assembly and positive air assist shut off for efficient slag removal and consistent gouge quality. The ergonomic 15° angled torch and 360° swivel cable improve operator comfort and control, while a durable cable cover and improved conduction extend service life in harsh conditions. With compatibility for a wide range of carbon electrode sizes and up to 1000 A of current, it delivers reliable gouging performance across applications.";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:125:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/k4000_gouging_torch_1_20260406_094852_0.webp";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T07:48:5