g-df-1_gas_regulator_20260407_071633_0.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:3;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16677;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"Rigrat";s:5:"model";s:36:"Transportable Multi-gas Area Monitor";s:4:"type";s:16:"Area Gas Monitor";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:685:"Honeywell BW™ RigRat brings a new level of user-friendliness to transportable multi-gas area monitoring. Simply place the monitor nearby, and it will alert workers to area gas threats so they can take necessary action.
