The Honeywell BW Clip Series 2-Year Single Gas Detector is a compact, maintenance-free personal safety sensor designed for reliable gas monitoring in hazardous work environments. It delivers up to 2 years of continuous operation with no need for battery charging, sensor replacement, or calibration — simply turn it on and go. The detector features automatic self-testing, one-button operation, and multi-mode alarms (audible, visual, vibrating) for instant alerts. With rugged construction, IP66/67 protection, and compatibility with Honeywell’s IntelliDoX and Safety Suite systems, it’s ideal for energy, manufacturing, and other industrial settings.";s:14:"specifications";s:277:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Parameter","value":"Gas Type|Sensor Range| Warranty"},{"label":"Value","value":"H2S, CO, O2, LEL, SO2|CO: 0-300 ppm\nH2S: 0-100 ppm\nSO2: 0-100ppm\no2: 0-25.0% by vol.|Full two-year warranty including all sensors"}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_clip_1_20260407_072940_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_clip_1_20260407_072940_0.jpg";i:1;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_clip_2_20260407_072941_1.jpg";i:2;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_clip_3_20260407_072942_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/bw_clip_datasheet_20260407_044220.pdf";}i:5;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16679;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:19:"single-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"BWC3-H";s:5:"model";s:48:"3-Year Clip Maintenance Free Single Gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:817:"Overview
Ensure continuous personal safety in hazardous environments with the Honeywell BW Clip Series single-gas detector — a compact, lightweight, maintenance-free solution designed for everyday use. This rugged detector delivers up to three years of continuous operation once activated, with no need for sensor or battery replacement, calibration, or charging — helping reduce downtime and total cost of ownership. 
Featuring an automated self-test, wide-angle alarm flash, audible and vibrating alerts, and compatibility with Honeywell’s IntelliDoX management system, the BW Clip Series offers reliable gas detection and easy compliance tracking. Ideal for industries such as energy, manufacturing, and government sectors, it’s the smart choice for effective single-gas monitoring and worker protection.";s:14:"specifications";s:190:"Specifications:
•        Gas Type: H2S, CO
•        Sensor Range:
o        CO: 0-300 ppm
o        H2S: 0-100 ppm
•        Warranty:  Full three-year warranty including all sensors";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bwc3-h_-_2_20260407_084253_0.webp";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bwc3-h_-_2_20260407_084253_0.webp";i:1;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bwc3-h_-_1_20260407_084253_1.webp";}s:9:"datasheet";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/bw_clip_datasheet_20260407_074139.pdf";}i:6;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16680;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:19:"single-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:4:"Solo";s:5:"model";s:31:"Serviceable Single Gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:847:"Overview
Ensure worker safety in hazardous environments with the Honeywell BW Solo single-gas detector — a lightweight, easy-to-service personal gas monitor designed for everyday industrial use. With Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) connectivity, real-time visibility, and seamless data integration through Honeywell’s Safety Suite software, the Solo helps companies respond quickly and confidently to potential gas hazards while simplifying compliance and reporting. 

Key features include a user-friendly interface, multilingual display, easy sensor/battery replacement, and compatibility with the Honeywell IntelliDoX docking system. Capable of detecting up to 15 common and specialty gases, this detector offers long-term cost savings through serviceability and dependable performance across energy, manufacturing, and utilities applications.";s:14:"specifications";s:613:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Parameter","value":"Gas Type|Sensor Range|Warranty"},{"label":"Value","value":"H2S, CO, O2, Cl2, ClO2, ETO, H2, HCN, NH3, NO, NO2, O3, PH3, SO2|o H2S (0-200ppm)\no CO (0-2000ppm)\no O2 (0-30%vol)\no Cl2 (0-50ppm)\no ClO2 (0-1ppm)\no ETO (0-100ppm)\no H2 (0-1000ppm)\no HCN (0-100ppm)\no NH3 (0-1000ppm)\no NO (0-250ppm)\no NO2 (0-100ppm)\no O3 (0-1ppm)\no PH3 (0-5ppm)\no SO2 (0-100ppm)|o 3 years for 1-Series detectors and sensors (H2S, CO, O2, CO2)\no 2 years for 4-Series detectors and sensors\no 1 year for NH3, Cl2, O3, ETO, ClO2, HCI, HF sensors"}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_solo_1_20260407_071958_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_solo_1_20260407_071958_0.jpg";i:1;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_solo_2_20260407_071959_1.jpg";i:2;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_solo_3_20260407_072000_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/bw_solo_datasheet_20260407_072001.pdf";}i:7;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16681;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"Clip 4";s:5:"model";s:41:"2 Year Low Maintenan