•        Enables the ability to change alarm set points, set a noncompliance indicator when a bump test is due, and adjust other parameters for maximum flexibility";s:14:"specifications";s:376:"Specifications:
•        Easy setup with a network or USB drive — no tools required
•        Expandable to five docking modules that can operate independently, while sharing power, network connection and calibration gas
•        Easy data transfer — by Ethernet or USB — from docking module to computer
•        Device management with Honeywell Safety Suite.";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_intellidox_1_20260407_072057_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_intellidox_1_20260407_072057_0.jpg";i:1;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_intellidox_2_20260407_072058_1.jpg";i:2;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_intellidox_3_20260407_072058_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/intellidox_datasheet_20260407_072103.pdf";}i:9;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16683;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:12:"Microclip XL";s:5:"model";s:18:"Multi-gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:979:"Keep workers safe in demanding industrial environments with the Honeywell BW MicroClip XL — a compact, rugged multi-gas detector designed for continuous personal protection. This unit simultaneously monitors four key gases — oxygen (O?), carbon monoxide (CO), hydrogen sulfide (H?S), and combustible gases (% LEL) — giving real-time awareness of hazardous atmospheres on the job. 

Built for ease of use with one-button operation, a clear LCD display of gas levels, and bright audible/visual/vibrating alarms, the MicroClip XL delivers reliable performance with up to 18 hours of runtime on a single charge and robust IP68 water and dust protection for tough conditions.

Device management and compliance reporting are simple with Honeywell SafetySuite software and compatibility with IntelliDoX docking stations. Ideal for energy, manufacturing, utilities, and confined-space entry work, the MicroClip XL is trusted for everyday gas hazard detection and worker safety.";s:14:"specifications";s:972:"Specifications:
•        Gases Detected: CO, H2S, O2, Combustible (% LEL) 
•        Number of Sensors: 4 
•        Sensor Ranges: 
o        CO: 0–500 ppm
o        H2S: 0–100 ppm
o        O2: 0–30 % vol
o        Combustible: 0–100 % LEL / 0–5.0 % v/v 
•        Weight: ~190 g 
•        Dimensions: ~11.3 × 6.0 × 3.2 cm 
•        Display: LCD with real-time gas concentrations 
•        Battery: Rechargeable battery with ~18 h runtime (~ 6 h charge) 
•        Alarms: Audible (~ 95 dB), visual, vibrating 
•        Ingress Protection: IP68 water & dust resistance 
•        Operating Temp: –20 °C to +50 °C 
•        Humidity: 0 – 95 % RH (non-condensing) 
•        Certifications: ATEX, IECEx, CE, CSA (Class I Div 1 A/B/C/D) 
•        Datalogging: Up to 16 h @ 15 sec intervals 
•        Wireless: BLE support for device-level connectivity 
•        Warranty: Full two-year warranty including all sensors";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_1_20260407_072425_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_1_20260407_072425_0.jpg";i:1;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_2_20260407_072425_1.jpg";i:2;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_3_20260407_072426_2.jpg";i:3;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_4_20260407_072426_3.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:125:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/microdockiidatasheet539614en_20260407_072427.pdf";}i:10;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16684;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:12:"MicroClip X3";s:5:"model";s:34:"3-Year Warranty Multi-gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:681:"The Honeywell BW MicroClip X3 is a rugged, wearable 4-gas portable detector that delivers reliable personal safety monitoring in demanding industrial environments. Designed for simultaneous detection of oxygen (O2), combustible gases (% LEL), hydrogen sulfide (H2S), and carbon monoxide (CO), it features a compact, ergonomic one-button design, intuitive LCD readout, and bright audible/visual/vibration alarms. With IP68 water and dust resistance, 18-hour battery life, and a 3-year warranty including a long-life oxygen sensor, the X3 is built for continuous daily use while simplifying compliance and device management with Honeywell’s SafetySuite and IntelliDoX connectivity.";s:14:"specifications";s:1124:"•	Gases Detected:
• Oxygen (O₂): 0–30.0 % vol
• Combustible gases (% LEL): 0–100 % LEL / 0–5.0 % v/v
• Hydrogen Sulfide (H₂S): 0–100 ppm
• Carbon Monoxide (CO): 0–500 ppm
•	Sensor Type & Life: Long-life sensors with expected 5-year service lifetime (O₂ sensor included) 
•	Battery / Runtime: Rechargeable lithium polymer — ~18 hours typical runtime; recharges in ≲ 6 hours 
•	Alarms: Audible (~95 dB), visual, and vibrating; low/high/TWA/STEL/OL alarm setpoints 
•	Display: Continuous LCD with real-time gas readings 
•	Ingress Protection: IP68 (water & dust resistant) 
•	Dimensions: ~11.3 × 6.0 × 3.2 cm / 4.4 × 2.4 × 1.2 in 
•	Weight: ~179 g / 6.3 oz 
•	Operating Temp: –20 °C to +50 °C (–4 °F to 122 °F) 
•	Humidity: 0–95 % RH (non-condensing) 
•	Wireless & Software: BLE connectivity; compatible with Honeywell SafetySuite device management and IntelliDoX automatic test/calibration stations 
•	Certifications: ATEX, IECEx, CSA Class I Div. 1 Groups A, B, C, D, CE conformity 
•	Warranty: Full three-year warranty including all sensors";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_1_20260407_073353_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_1_20260407_073353_0.jpg";i:1;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_2_20260407_073355_1.jpg";i:2;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_3_20260407_073355_2.jpg";i:3;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microclip_x3_-_4_20260407_073356_3.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:11;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16685;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:9:"Max XT II";s:5:"model";s:37:"Multi-gas Detector with Sampling Pump";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:756:"The Honeywell BW Max XT II Multi-Gas Detector is a rugged, reliable portable gas monitor built to keep workers safe in hazardous environments. Designed for simultaneous detection of four key gases — oxygen (O2), combustible gases (% LEL), hydrogen sulfide (H2S), and carbon monoxide (CO) — it features one-button operation, an integrated SmartSample pump for remote sampling, and continuous LCD readouts of gas levels. With IntelliFlash visual compliance indication, standard datalogging, and compatibility with Honeywell’s MicroDock II automated test/calibration system, this unit delivers dependable performance for confined-space entry, utilities, oil & gas, and general industrial applications while streamlining safety management and compliance.";s:14:"specifications";s:1712:"Specifications:
•        Gases Detected:
o        Oxygen (O2)
o        Combustible gases (% LEL) / 0–5.0 % v/v
o        Hydrogen Sulfide (H2S)
o        Carbon Monoxide (CO)
•        Sensor Ranges & Resolution
o        H2S: 0–200 ppm (1 ppm)
o        CO: 0–1000 ppm (1 ppm)
o        O2: 0–30.0 % (0.1 %)
o        Combustible: 0–100 % LEL / 0–5.0 % v/v (1 % / 0.1 %)
•        Physical / Environmental
•        Size: ~13.1 × 7.0 × 5.2 cm (5.1 × 2.8 × 2.0 in)
•        Weight: ~328 g (11.5 oz)
•        Operating Temperature: –20 °C to +50 °C (–4 °F to 122 °F)
•        Humidity: 10 – 100 % RH (non-condensing) 
•        Alarms & Indicators
•        Audible (95 dB), visual, vibrating alarms
•        Settable thresholds: Low, High, STEL, TWA, OL (Over Limit), low battery, pump alerts
•        Bright wide-angled visual alarm bars
•        IntelliFlash™ continuous visual compliance indicator 
•        Display & Logging
•        Continuous LCD shows real-time gas concentrations
•        Standard datalogging and event logging (~375 h @ 15 s intervals) 
•        Battery & Pump
•        Rechargeable battery (~13 h @ 0 °C / ~8 h @ –20 °C)
•        Recharges in ~6 h
•        Integrated SmartSample motorized pump (can draw samples from up to ~23 m / 75 ft) 
•        Durability & Compliance
•        Water-resistant (IP66/67 rated)
•        Built-in concussion-proof boot
•        Compatible with MicroDock II automated calibration/test system
•        Multi-language support (English, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese)
•        Certifications: ATEX, IECEx, UL Class I Div. 1 Groups A/B/C/D, etc.";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_max_xt_ii_1_20260407_073505_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_max_xt_ii_1_20260407_073505_0.jpg";i:1;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_max_xt_ii_2_20260407_073506_1.jpg";i:2;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_max_xt_ii_3_20260407_073508_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:12;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16686;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:4:"Icon";s:5:"model";s:42:"Icon Displayed 2 Year - Multi-gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:558:"Features and Benefits
•        Two months of battery runtime on a 4.5-hour charge
•        Compatible with the IntelliDoX instrument management system and Honeywell Safety Suite and with TouchConnect™ using Bluetooth® for wireless configuration
•        Low-power infrared LEL sensor is immune to silicone poisoning, which means accurate monitoring of combustibles.
•        The IntelliFlash™ green light indicates when the detector is complying, and the amber light indicates the need for maintenance.
•        Responsive and easy to use";s:14:"specifications";s:523:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Parameter","value":"• Size|• Weight|• Temperature|• Sensor Range|• Warranty"},{"label":"Value","value":"(4.29 in x 2.44 in x1.7 in) with Alligator Clip\n(4.29 in x 2.44 in x 1.49 in) with Klick Fast Stud|6.5 oz. / 185 g (Alligator Clip)\n6 oz. / 169 g (Klick Fast Stud)|-20 to +50° C|o CO – 0 to 2000 ppm\no H2S – 0 to 200 ppm\no SO2 – 0 to 150 ppm\no O2 – 0 to 30% VOL\no NDIR-CH4 – 0 to 100% LEL|Two-year warranty for sensors and detector"}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_icon_1_20260407_074027_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_icon_1_20260407_074027_0.jpg";i:1;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_icon_2_20260407_074028_1.webp";i:2;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_icon_3_20260407_074028_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/bw_icon_datasheet_20260407_073630.pdf";}i:13;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16687;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"multi-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:5:"Ultra";s:5:"model";s:24:"5-gas Multi-gas Detector";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:584:"The Honeywell BW™ Ultra Multi-Gas Detector is a rugged, portable gas monitor engineered for confined space air sampling and safety checks. Designed with intuitive operation, fast-responding sensors, and robust construction, the BW Ultra simultaneously detects multiple hazardous gases and helps workers make informed decisions quickly. With built-in Bluetooth connectivity, long battery life, and comprehensive datalogging, it’s ideal for industrial safety teams, energy facilities, water treatment plants, and other heavy-duty environments requiring reliable multi-gas detection.";s:14:"specifications";s:1170:"Specifications:
•        Sensor Range: 
o        O2 (0–25%)
o        LEL (0–100%LEL)
o        H2S (0–100 ppm)
o        CO (0–2000 ppm)
o        SO2 (0–100 ppm)
o        H2 (0–2000 ppm)
o        CO2 (0–50 000 ppm)
o        NH3 (0–100 ppm)
o        VOC (0–1000 ppm)
o        Cl2 (0–20 ppm)
o        NO2 (0–50 ppm)
o        HCN (0–100 ppm)
o        NO (0–200 ppm) 
o        Infrared (IR) sensor option included 
•        Humidity Range: 5–95% RH (non-condensing) 
•        Operating Temperature: -20 °C to 50 °C (-4 °F to 131 °F) 
•        Alarm Types: Audible (95 dB), visual, vibrating 
•        Alarm Settings: Low, High, STEL, TWA, OL (Over Limit) 
•        Typical Battery Life: 14–18 hours (varies with sensor configuration) 
•        Batteries included 
•        Capable of datalogging up to 45 days based on 8-hour shifts at 15-second intervals 
•        Built-in pump with sampling draw up to 75 ft (23 m) 
•        Ingress Protection: IP66/IP68 
•        Certified to ATEX, IECEx, CE, and UL (Class I, Div.1 / Zone 0) standards 
•        Stores 30 alarm events and 10 bump events";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_ultra_1_20260407_073719_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_ultra_1_20260407_073719_0.jpg";i:1;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_ultra_2_20260407_073720_1.jpg";i:2;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_ultra_3_20260407_073720_2.jpg";i:3;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_ultra_4_20260407_073722_3.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:115:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/bw_ultra_datasheet_20260407_073723.pdf";}i:14;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16688;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:23:"docking-data-management";s:5:"brand";s:2:"BW";s:12:"product_name";s:12:"Microdock II";s:5:"model";s:37:"Automated Test and Calibration System";s:4:"type";s:33:"Portable Gas Detector Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1053:"Features & Benefits:
•        Fully automatic "hands-free" calibration and functional bump testing
•        Automatically verifies performance of audible and visual alarms
•        Stores and updates calibration records in the MicroDock II, as well as in datalogging instruments
•        Entirely self-contained with no computer required
•        Lightweight and fully portable with optional wall mount
•        Operates via 6V line power or a set of four C-cell batteries
•        Fully customizable
•        Add extra self-contained docking modules to system via simple, plug-in connections no external pressure transducers or gas lines necessary
•        Simple, accurate record keeping and fleet management
•        Verifies proper performance of detectors
•        Reduces maintenance costs
•        Multiple MicroDock II systems can be connected via a LAN
•        Includes BW Fleet Manager software for easy data analysis
•        Multi-language support in English, French, German, Spanish and Portuguese";s:14:"specifications";s:1305:"Specifications:
•        Size: 8.3 x 10.4 x 3.2 in. / 21.2 x 26.3 x 8.2 cm (base station plus one docking module)
•        Power Supply: 6V wall adaptor or four C-cell batteries
•        Real-time clock: Provides time and date stamp for “last calibration” and “last bump test” data
•        Data Storage: Automatic (instrument and base station) MultiMediaCard data storage system
•        Communications method: Infrared communication between docking module and detector
•        External interface: USB 2.0 interface for PC (USB 2.0 full speed)
•        Pump: DC motor, micro-diaphragm; 6V PCB mount. Flow rate 300 ml/min (typically)
•        Solenoid: Built-in (docking modules)
•        Calibration gas connections: 1/8" SMC connect sub-miniature coupling, 2 gas inlets (standard), 5 gas inlets (maximum)
•        Detector configuration: Automatic recognition of instrument and sensors. User-settable with Fleet Manager II software
•        Command Keys: Base station - Menu navigation Docking module
o        One touch bump-test initiation
o        One touch calibration intitation
o        One touch data transfer (specific products)
•        LED indicators: Yellow “TEST”, Green “PASS”, Red “FAIL”
•        Warranty: Full 2 year warranty";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microdock_ii_1_20260407_084407_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:31:"2026-04-07T06:44:12.99404+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microdock_ii_1_20260407_084407_0.jpg";i:1;s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microdock_ii_2_20260407_084408_1.jpg";i:2;s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/bw_microdock_ii_3_20260407_084409_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:125:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/microdockiidatasheet539614en_20260407_073935.pdf";}}}s:7:"CHIYODA";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16161;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:20:"gas-saving-regulator";s:5:"brand";s:7:"CHIYODA";s:12:"product_name";s:16:"Econodial Series";s:5:"model";s:40:"Gas Saving Regulator with Dial Flowmeter";s:4:"type";s:20:"Gas Saving Regulator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:295:"“ECONO-DIAL" is developed to minimize the discharge of wasteful gas in TIG, MIG, and CO2 welding.
It keeps gas flow at constant rate as from start of welding and assures smooth arc start and energy saving without causing deterioration of weld quality.
Approximately, 40% gas saving possible.";s:14:"specifications";s:818:"{"format":"andison_specs_v2","text":"","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["MODEL","B-AR","B-CO2","H-AR, HCO2 with mini-regulator","H-AR, HCO2"],"rows":[["Applicable Gas","Argon, Mix Gas","CO2","Argon, CO2, Mix gas","Argon, CO2, Mix gas"],["Connect To","To Cylinder","To Cylinder","To Pipeline Outlet","To Pipeline Outlet"],["Flow Rate Range","3-15 NL/min.\n6-30 NL/min.\n10-50 NL/min.","6-30 NL/min.\n10-50 NL/min.","3-15 NL/min.\n6-30 NL/min.\n10-50 NL/min.","3-15 NL/min.6-30 NL/min.10-50 NL/min."],["Inlet Pressure","Max. 165 kg/cm2","Max. 60 kg/cm2","3.5-10 kg/cm2","3 kg/cm2"],["Inlet Connection","J.I.s, C.G.A., B.S., D.I.N., etc","","W22-M14 or others",""],["Outlet Connection","1/4\" Hose Nipple","","",""]],"merges":[{"row":4,"col":1,"span":2},{"row":4,"col":3,"span":2},{"row":5,"col":1,"span":4}]}}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/b-ar_type_20260407_045137_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-07T02:51:42.978412+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:4:{i:0;s:112:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/b-ar_type_20260407_045137_0.jpg";i:1;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/b-co2_type_20260407_045138_1.jpg";i:2;s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/h-ar_h-co2_type_20260407_045138_2.jpg";i:3;s:138:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/h-ar_h-co2_with_mini-regulator_type_20260407_045139_3.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:6:"COPPUS";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:11:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16791;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"electric-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:17:"Air Max 12 Blower";s:5:"model";s:41:"Economical, High-Volume Tube Axial Blower";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:431:"This 12-inch, low profile, rugged blower delivers up to 2,200 CFM for confined space ventilation and fresh air supply.

Features:
•        Rugged, all-steel housing construction
•        Integral on/off motor switch
•        Fixed guide vanes for improved performance
•        Glass-reinforced, polypropylene, non-sparking fan blade
•        20-foot cord with GFCI at plug ends
•        Anti-vibration foot pads";s:14:"specifications";s:947:"{"format":"andison_specs_v2","text":"Specifications :\nMOTOR: TE 3/4 HP, with integral on/off switch, 115V/6.8 amp, class B insulation, auto reset thermal overload protection; attached 20-foot     heavy-duty cord with GFCI shut-off at plug end.\n\nFREE AIR: 2,200 CFM\nWEIGHT: 44 lbs (18.14 kg)\nHOUSING: 18-gage steel, powder-coated with carry handle and anti-vibration foot pads; rolled bead on ends for added strength and attaching flexible ducting; attached, safety screens per OSHA guidelines.","tableMatrix":{"mode":"grouped-pairs","leadColumns":1,"headers":["Model","cfm","m3/hr","cfm","m3/hr","cfm","m3/hr","cfm","m3/hr"],"groups":[{"title":"Free Air","span":2,"rowSpan":false},{"title":"10 ft.   3.05 M","span":2,"rowSpan":false},{"title":"20 ft.   6.10 M","span":2,"rowSpan":false},{"title":"30 ft.   9.15 M","span":2,"rowSpan":false}],"rows":[["Air Max","2,200","3,740","2,120","3,602","2,025","3,440","1,890","3,211"]],"rowMerges":[]}}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/air-max_12_20260407_045411_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:113:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/air-max_12_20260407_045411_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:123:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_airmax-12_datasheet_20260407_045413.pdf";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16792;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"electric-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:23:"Double Duty Heat Killer";s:5:"model";s:69:"Powerful Industrial Fan for Cooling Products, Processes and Personnel";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1039:"With airflows up to 17,000 cfm the Double-duty Heat Killer (DDHK) is one of the most powerful and versatile portable air movers on the market today. The patented, adjustable guide vane design allows air flow control - from a gentle breeze for personnel cooling, to a concentrated jet blast for product and process cooling.

Features:
•        Adjustable guide vanes allow varied air movement from a gentle breeze to a jet blast
•        Available in 18-, 24- and 30-inch (457, 610, 762 mm) models
•        18- (457 mm) and 24-inch (610 mm) models available with optional two speed, totally enclosed motors (115V only)
•        Models available in floor stand or wall mount models
•        Heavy-duty, rugged steel housing and frame
•        Protective screens meet OSHA guidelines
•        Available with TE and EP motors
•        Hazardous location switches and motors meet NEC Class I, Division I, Group D and Class II, Division I, Groups F and G specifications
•        Thermal overload protection on motors";s:14:"specifications";s:2588:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"see specs table Coppus Portable Ventilators.doc","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Motor Type</th><th>Fan Size and Type</th><th>Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)</th><th>Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Air Max 12</td><td>Electric</td><td>12” (305mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>2,200 (3,735)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Cadet</td><td>Electric or gas</td><td>8” (203mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>804-867 (1,358-1,465)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Double Duty Heat Killer</td><td>Electric</td><td>24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)</td><td>7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)</td><td>Floor mount and optional wall mount</td></tr><tr><td>Jectair / Jectair Hornet</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi</td><td>1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)</td><td>Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow</td></tr><tr><td>Reaction Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>12” (305mm),16” (406mm)</td><td>2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)</td><td>Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing</td></tr><tr><td>Reactions Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>20” (508mm),24” (610mm)</td><td>11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)</td><td>Flange mount directly to standard API manways</td></tr><tr><td>Vano 175 CV, 250 CV</td><td>Electric</td><td>8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial</td><td>1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)</td><td>Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Product","Motor Type","Fan Size and Type","Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)","Features"],"rows":[["Air Max 12","Electric","12” (305mm) Vaneaxial","2,200 (3,735)","Lightweight, compact"],["Cadet","Electric or gas","8” (203mm) Vaneaxial","804-867 (1,358-1,465)","Lightweight, compact"],["Double Duty Heat Killer","Electric","24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)","7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)","Floor mount and optional wall mount"],["Jectair / Jectair Hornet","Compressed Air","Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi","1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)","Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow"],["Reaction Fans","Compressed Air","12” (305mm),16” (406mm)","2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)","Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing"],["Reactions Fans","Compressed Air","20” (508mm),24” (610mm)","11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)","Flange mount directly to standard API manways"],["Vano 175 CV, 250 CV","Electric","8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial","1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)","Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover"]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:128:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/double-duty-heat-killer-1_20260407_050114_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:128:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/double-duty-heat-killer-1_20260407_050114_0.png";i:1;s:128:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/double_duty_heat_killer-2_20260407_050115_1.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:127:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_double-duty_heat_killer_20260407_050117.pdf";}i:2;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16793;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"electric-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:24:"Vano 175 CV, Vano 250 CV";s:5:"model";s:42:"Rugged, reliable and versatile ventilators";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1252:"COPPUS revolutionized air moving equipment more than 60 years ago with the introduction of theVANO models. The VANO models offer a fixed guide vane design that delivers high volumes of air while maintaining static pressure for exhausting fumes and delivering fresh air. A rugged, durable, high-performance design makes the VANOs ideal for ventilating tanks, process vessels, tank cars, manholes and other confined spaces.

•        MODEL 175CV: 3/4 HP, 1,500 cfm (2,549 m3/hr)
•        MODEL 250CV: 1 HP, 3,000 cfm (5,098 m3/hr)

Features:
•        Straightening vanes for improved static pressure performance
•        Accepts ducting on inlet and outlet ends
•        Available with totally enclosed (TE) or explosion-proof (EP) motors and compatible switch; all single-phase models supplied with 15-foot power cord. 
•        Heavy-gauge, powder-coated steel and cast aluminum construction
•        Spark-resistant fan blades
•        Removable sleeve on 175CV and 250CV converts inlet from accepting duct to side-cutout version for exhausting fumes from bottom of tanks
•        Automatic reset thermal overload protection standard on VANO 175CV and 250CV models
•        Optional tripod and transport cart available";s:14:"specifications";s:2541:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Motor Type</th><th>Fan Size and Type</th><th>Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)</th><th>Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Air Max 12</td><td>Electric</td><td>12” (305mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>2,200 (3,735)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Cadet</td><td>Electric or gas</td><td>8” (203mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>804-867 (1,358-1,465)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Double Duty Heat Killer</td><td>Electric</td><td>24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)</td><td>7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)</td><td>Floor mount and optional wall mount</td></tr><tr><td>Jectair / Jectair Hornet</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi</td><td>1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)</td><td>Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow</td></tr><tr><td>Reaction Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>12” (305mm),16” (406mm)</td><td>2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)</td><td>Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing</td></tr><tr><td>Reactions Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>20” (508mm),24” (610mm)</td><td>11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)</td><td>Flange mount directly to standard API manways</td></tr><tr><td>Vano 175 CV, 250 CV</td><td>Electric</td><td>8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial</td><td>1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)</td><td>Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Product","Motor Type","Fan Size and Type","Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)","Features"],"rows":[["Air Max 12","Electric","12” (305mm) Vaneaxial","2,200 (3,735)","Lightweight, compact"],["Cadet","Electric or gas","8” (203mm) Vaneaxial","804-867 (1,358-1,465)","Lightweight, compact"],["Double Duty Heat Killer","Electric","24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)","7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)","Floor mount and optional wall mount"],["Jectair / Jectair Hornet","Compressed Air","Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi","1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)","Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow"],["Reaction Fans","Compressed Air","12” (305mm),16” (406mm)","2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)","Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing"],["Reactions Fans","Compressed Air","20” (508mm),24” (610mm)","11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)","Flange mount directly to standard API manways"],["Vano 175 CV, 250 CV","Electric","8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial","1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)","Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover"]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:107:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/vano_20260407_050354_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:107:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/vano_20260407_050354_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:118:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_vano_datasheet_20260407_050355.pdf";}i:3;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16794;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"electric-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:5:"Cadet";s:5:"model";s:37:"Vaneaxial and Centrifugal Ventilators";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1063:"These versatile, rugged, economical ventilators deliver exceptional airflow in a compact, lightweight design, and their non-corrosive injection molded housing is virtually indestructible. They are ideal for utility underground and light manufacturing confined space ventilation, and are available in a variety of models.

Vaneaxial Models
•        Flame-resistant UL94-V2-rated injection molded housing (5VA is the highest UL flame retardant rating possible)
•        Glass-filled, polyester resin, spark-resistant fan blade
•        Accommodates 8-inch flexible duct
•        Optional attachable duct canister

Centrifugal Models
•        Excellent airflow and pressure performance 
•        Flame-resistant UL94-V2 injection-molded housing
•        Glass-filled, polyester resin spark resistant fan blade
•        Accommodates 8-inch duct on inlet and outlet ends
•        Fan scroll can be positioned easily at 45 degree, 90 degree and 
180 degree discharge positions
•        Available in electric and gasoline-driven models";s:14:"specifications";s:2541:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Motor Type</th><th>Fan Size and Type</th><th>Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)</th><th>Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Air Max 12</td><td>Electric</td><td>12” (305mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>2,200 (3,735)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Cadet</td><td>Electric or gas</td><td>8” (203mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>804-867 (1,358-1,465)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Double Duty Heat Killer</td><td>Electric</td><td>24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)</td><td>7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)</td><td>Floor mount and optional wall mount</td></tr><tr><td>Jectair / Jectair Hornet</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi</td><td>1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)</td><td>Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow</td></tr><tr><td>Reaction Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>12” (305mm),16” (406mm)</td><td>2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)</td><td>Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing</td></tr><tr><td>Reactions Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>20” (508mm),24” (610mm)</td><td>11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)</td><td>Flange mount directly to standard API manways</td></tr><tr><td>Vano 175 CV, 250 CV</td><td>Electric</td><td>8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial</td><td>1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)</td><td>Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Product","Motor Type","Fan Size and Type","Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)","Features"],"rows":[["Air Max 12","Electric","12” (305mm) Vaneaxial","2,200 (3,735)","Lightweight, compact"],["Cadet","Electric or gas","8” (203mm) Vaneaxial","804-867 (1,358-1,465)","Lightweight, compact"],["Double Duty Heat Killer","Electric","24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)","7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)","Floor mount and optional wall mount"],["Jectair / Jectair Hornet","Compressed Air","Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi","1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)","Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow"],["Reaction Fans","Compressed Air","12” (305mm),16” (406mm)","2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)","Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing"],["Reactions Fans","Compressed Air","20” (508mm),24” (610mm)","11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)","Flange mount directly to standard API manways"],["Vano 175 CV, 250 CV","Electric","8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial","1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)","Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover"]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:108:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/cadet_20260407_045618_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:108:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/cadet_20260407_045618_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_cadet_vaneaxial_20260407_045620.pdf";}i:4;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16795;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:16:"pneumatic-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:13:"Reaction Fans";s:5:"model";s:24:"Air-Driven Reaction Fans";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1337:"Rugged, cast aluminum housing and fan blade make these fans ideal for hazardous locations and demanding ventilation projects. The RF design utilizes action-reaction principles; compressed air is discharged through nozzles located at the tip of the fan blades providing extremely efficient, high-volume, low maintenance air movers.

RF-20, RF-24 Features
•        For 20 inch (50.8 cm) to 24 inch (60.96 cm) tank man ways
•        11,000 to 16,900 cfm (18,689 to 28,713 m3/hr) at 80 psig
•        Use for fresh air supply or fume exhaust
•        Can be carried or rolled to job site
•        Spark resistant cast aluminum housing and fan blade
•        Permanently lubricated bearings
•        Flanges mate with 20-inch (508mm) and 24-inch (610mm) API tank opening
•        Swing-Out Assembly

RF-12, RF-16 Features
•        2,100 to 5,100 CFM (3,566 to 8,665 m3/hr) at 80 psig
•        Use for fresh air supply or fume exhaust
•        Low compressed air consumption
•        Spark-resistant, cast aluminum housing and fan blade
•        Virtually maintenance free
•        Permanently lubricated bearings eliminate line oiler
•        Cast in handles and feet
•        Cast in bead to accept 12-inch and 16-inch duct
•        Bolt holes allow attachment of optional adapter plates";s:14:"specifications";s:2541:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Motor Type</th><th>Fan Size and Type</th><th>Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)</th><th>Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Air Max 12</td><td>Electric</td><td>12” (305mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>2,200 (3,735)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Cadet</td><td>Electric or gas</td><td>8” (203mm) Vaneaxial</td><td>804-867 (1,358-1,465)</td><td>Lightweight, compact</td></tr><tr><td>Double Duty Heat Killer</td><td>Electric</td><td>24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)</td><td>7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)</td><td>Floor mount and optional wall mount</td></tr><tr><td>Jectair / Jectair Hornet</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi</td><td>1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)</td><td>Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow</td></tr><tr><td>Reaction Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>12” (305mm),16” (406mm)</td><td>2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)</td><td>Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing</td></tr><tr><td>Reactions Fans</td><td>Compressed Air</td><td>20” (508mm),24” (610mm)</td><td>11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)</td><td>Flange mount directly to standard API manways</td></tr><tr><td>Vano 175 CV, 250 CV</td><td>Electric</td><td>8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial</td><td>1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)</td><td>Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Product","Motor Type","Fan Size and Type","Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)","Features"],"rows":[["Air Max 12","Electric","12” (305mm) Vaneaxial","2,200 (3,735)","Lightweight, compact"],["Cadet","Electric or gas","8” (203mm) Vaneaxial","804-867 (1,358-1,465)","Lightweight, compact"],["Double Duty Heat Killer","Electric","24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)","7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)","Floor mount and optional wall mount"],["Jectair / Jectair Hornet","Compressed Air","Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi","1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)","Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow"],["Reaction Fans","Compressed Air","12” (305mm),16” (406mm)","2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)","Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing"],["Reactions Fans","Compressed Air","20” (508mm),24” (610mm)","11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)","Flange mount directly to standard API manways"],["Vano 175 CV, 250 CV","Electric","8” (203mm) and12” (305mm) Vanexial","1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)","Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover"]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/reaction_fan-1_20260407_045943_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/reaction_fan-1_20260407_045943_0.jpg";i:1;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/reaction_fan-2_20260407_045945_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:126:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_reaction_fan_datasheet_20260407_045946.pdf";}i:5;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16796;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:16:"pneumatic-driven";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:21:"Jectair and Hornet HP";s:5:"model";s:53:"High-Performance, Highly-Efficient Venturi Air Movers";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1491:"The unmatched performance of the COPPUS Jectair HP is recognized throughout the industry. When compared with older-style air horns, the patented air mixing chamber of the Jectair HP produces up to 26 percent savings on compressed air consumption.

Operating Principle:
Compressed air or steam is admitted to the Jectair through a single inlet connection in the housing leading to the mixing chamber. The air or steam jetted from the nozzle creates a Venturi action which induces a large volume of surrounding air to enter the Jectair through the aerodynamic inlet bell. The air is then discharged at high velocity through the horn-shaped diffuser. 
NOTE: Operating efficiency depends on compressed air volume and pressure.

Features:
•        Available in five sizes: 9, 8, 6-HP, 3-HP, 3S-HP
•        High-Performance (HP) and Hornet models available in three sizes: 6-HP, 3-HP and 3S-HP
•        Air flows range from 1,370 to 8,900 cfm (2,328 to 15,121m3/hr)
•        Induction ratios up to 40:1
•        Multiple expansion nozzles machined into housing
•        High static pressure capabilities
•        Diffuser material available in steel, aluminum or shock-resistant polymer (Hornet HP)
•        No moving parts — virtually maintenance-free
•        Static bonding cable with spring tension grip and replaceable contact tips standard on all models
•        Accepts flexible duct on diffuser end
•        Tripod for stationary mounting available";s:14:"specifications";s:1098:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Product","value":"Air Max 12|Cadet|Double Duty Heat Killer|Jectair / Jectair Hornet|Reaction Fans|Reactions Fans|Vano 175 CV, 250 CV"},{"label":"Motor Type","value":"Electric|Electric or gas|Electric|Compressed Air|Compressed Air|Compressed Air|Electric"},{"label":"Fan Size and Type","value":"12” (305mm) Vaneaxial|8” (203mm) Vaneaxial|24” (610mm) and30” (762mm)|Discharge sizes 8” (203mm) to 14” (356mm) Venturi|12” (305mm),16” (406mm)|20” (508mm),24” (610mm)|8” (203mm) and 12” (305mm) Vanexial"},{"label":"Air Flows CFM (m3/hr)","value":"2,200 (3,735)|804-867 (1,358-1,465)|7,100-17,000(12,000-28,890)|1,370-8,900(2,328-15,121)|2,140-5,100(3,636-8,665)|11,000-16,900 (18,689-28,700)|1,500-3,000(2,549-5,098)"},{"label":"Features","value":"Lightweight, compact|Lightweight, compact|Floor mount and optional wall mount|Lightweight, no moving parts, variable flow|Ideal for hazardous locations; all aluminum-cast housing|Flange mount directly to standard API manways|Rugged, durable, versatile utility air mover"}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:110:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/jectair_20260407_050249_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:110:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/jectair_20260407_050249_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:121:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/coppus_jectair_datasheet_20260407_050250.pdf";}i:6;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16797;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:31:"portable-ventilator-accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:11:"Vano Tripod";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:219:"Attaches to VANO 175CV or 250CV; makes positioning of units and direction of airflow easier by rotating 360 degrees on a 45 degree plane. Spring-loaded legs fold up for easy transport and storage. Weight: 19 lbs (9 kg).";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/vano_tripod_20260407_061617_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/vano_tripod_20260407_061617_0.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:7;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16798;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:31:"portable-ventilator-accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:14:"Transport Cart";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:225:"Vaneaxial and Centrifugal models. These versatile, rugged, economical ventilators 
deliver exceptional airflow in a compact, lightweight design, and their non-corrosive 
injection molded housing is virtually indestructible.";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/transport_cart_20260407_061716_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/transport_cart_20260407_061716_0.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:8;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16799;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:31:"portable-ventilator-accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:17:"Flexible Air Duct";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:335:"COPPUS carries a large selection of flexible air duct for a variety of ventilation application needs. Our most popular heavy duty duct features impregnated polyester duct designed for harsh, industrial environments. Our other selections include: economical light duty duct, source capture duct and hazardous location, anti-static duct.";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/flexible_air_duct_20260407_061804_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:120:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/flexible_air_duct_20260407_061804_0.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:9;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16800;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:31:"portable-ventilator-accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:14:"Duct Cannister";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:327:"Extend the life of your duct with the protection of a COPPUS high-density, light-weight polyethylene canister; makes transporting and storage easier and safer. 

Canisters for duct sizes:
•        8-inch x 25-inch (203mm x 635mm)
•        12-inch x 20-inch (305mm x 508mm) 
•        16-inch x 30-inch (406mm x 762mm)";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:116:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/duct_canister_20260407_061833_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:116:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/duct_canister_20260407_061833_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:10;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16801;s:11:"category_id";s:20:"portable-ventilators";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:31:"portable-ventilator-accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"COPPUS";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:14:"Jectair Tripod";s:4:"type";s:19:"Portable Ventilator";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:296:"For stationary, long term use; rotates 360 degrees for precise direction of air flow and accommodates 3HP and 6HP Jectair sizes. Installs quickly and easily with two quick-release clamps. Large feet provide stability during operation and spring-loaded legs fold up for easy transport and storage.";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/jectair_tripod_20260407_061900_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:24:12.548886+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:117:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/jectair_tripod_20260407_061900_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:4:"Dalo";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16645;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:18:"industrial-markers";s:5:"brand";s:4:"Dalo";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:17:"Industrial Marker";s:4:"type";s:17:"Industrial Marker";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:978:"The DALO® marker stands out for its distinctive medium and broad oil-based paint markings. Its stainless steel-ball valve action tip writes through oil, grease and underwater without losing legibility or brightness even in extreme conditions.

•        Available in 2 tip sizes.
•        Write sharp, defined, bright marks on any surface including metal, plastic, 
       glass, concrete, rubber and more
•        Ergonomically correct marker that enables you to mark at all angles, even upside
       down
•        Marker retains its shape unlike tube-style markers
•        Paint flow is controlled by the pressure bulb at the end of the barrel
•        Extra large paint capacity
•        Ergonomically correct marker that enables you to mark at all angles, even 
       upside down.
•        Able to use all of its paint inside without any waste
•        Drying Time is 25-35 minutes
•        Available Colors: Yellow 26063 and White 26083";s:14:"specifications";s:0:"";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:109:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/dalo_1_20260407_074537_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-07T05:45:41.467892+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:109:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/dalo_1_20260407_074537_0.jpg";i:1;s:109:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/dalo_2_20260407_074537_1.jpg";i:2;s:109:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/dalo_3_20260407_074538_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:10:"DryRod. II";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:3:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16656;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:22:"welding-electrode-oven";s:5:"brand";s:10:"DryRod. II";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"Type 2";s:5:"model";s:23:"Portable Electrode Oven";s:4:"type";s:22:"Welding Electrode Oven";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:546:"Features
