Panasonic DTPS III is advanced offline teaching, programming, and simulation software designed to streamline robotic welding system setup and optimization. It enables engineers and integrators to design, simulate, and edit welding programs in a virtual 3D workspace, significantly reducing commissioning time, minimizing errors, and boosting productivity before deployment on the shop floor. 

Key Features
• Offline Teaching & Simulation
Create and verify robot movements, weld paths, and task sequences on your PC without needing to stop production. 
• 3D CAD Import & Geometry Tools
Import 3D CAD models or create simple geometry directly in the software to plan layouts, ensure reachability, and avoid collisions. 
• Collision & Interference Checking
Simulate and detect reach limit breaches or possible robot/jig collisions before physical implementation. 
• Program Editing & Management
Edit welding commands, adjust steps, copy sequences, and modify conditions easily with powerful editing tools. 
• Takt Time Calculation & Analysis Tools
Estimate cycle times and optimize process flow to support planning and takt balancing early in the design phase. 
• Automatic Data Handling
Backup welding logs, error histories, and waveform data via network connection for easier traceability and quality control. 
• Lightweight & Portable
Runs efficiently on Windows-based laptops and PCs that meet the software requirements, enabling field use or consultation.";s:14:"specifications";s:560:"Benefits for Your Production Workflow
•        Faster Start-Up – Significantly reduce on-site teaching and commissioning time by preparing programs offline. 
•        Error Prevention – Validate robot motion and detect clashes in a virtual environment to avoid costly rework. 
•        Higher Productivity – Simulate entire welding processes and optimize for cycle time and takt rate before going live. 
•        Improved Quality & Flexibility – Supports CAD data workflows and advanced editing, making process changes faster and more accurate.";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T03:48:46.851784+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:30;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14802;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:30:"featured-products-and-solution";s:5:"brand";s:17:"Panasonic Connect";s:12:"product_name";s:10:"i-Reporter";s:5:"model";s:44:"Electronic Reporting & Data Capture Solution";s:4:"type";s:17:"Arc Welding Robot";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:1287:"Overview
i-Reporter is a digital reporting tool within Panasonic’s Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) suite that transforms paper-based forms into digital data instantly to improve accuracy, efficiency, and operational visibility. It helps manufacturers move to a paperless system, streamline reporting workflows, and accelerate decision-making with real-time access to information directly from the shop floor. 

Key Features
• Paperless Reporting & Data Capture
Eliminate manual form filling and paper handling by converting traditional reports into digital formats instantly, reducing printing and storage costs. 
• Improved Operational Efficiency
Completes on-site recording and reporting workflows faster and cuts lead time for post-processing, enabling quicker approvals and collaboration. 
• Higher Data Accuracy & Freshness
Digital input significantly reduces errors from handwriting or manual data entry, enabling real-time data visibility. 
• Streamlined Information Sharing
Instantly share updated reports across teams and remote locations, improving communication and responsiveness. 
• Paper Reduction & Cost Savings
Cuts costs associated with printing, storing, checking and re-entering paper documents, while reducing warehouse space for paper archives.";s:14:"specifications";s:568:"Benefits for Your Production Workflow
•        Accelerate Reporting Workflows: Digitized forms shorten the time from data capture to actionable insights. 
•        Boost Quality & Compliance: Automated data capture improves accuracy and traceability for audits and quality control. 
•        Enhance Real-Time Visibility: Access current data from the factory floor for better decision-making and faster responses. 
•        Drive Paperless Operations: Move your reporting system toward full digital transformation, reducing manual effort and operational waste.";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T03:48:46.851784+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:3:"RAC";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:3:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14409;s:11:"category_id";s:13:"gas-detectors";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:19:"single-gas-detector";s:5:"brand";s:3:"RAC";s:12:"product_name";s:11:"ToxiRAE Pro";s:5:"model";s:52:"Personal Wireless Monitor for Toxic Gases and Oxygen";s:4:"type";s:21:"Portable Gas Detector";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:589:"Features and Benefits:
