Features :
•        Based on CENELEC HD 22-6 31, VDE 0282, IEC 245-6, IS 473, BS 638-4
•        Outstanding toughness & durability
•        High resistance to cuts, tears, and abrasion
•        Resistance to oil, solvents, and chemicals
•        Excellent ozone and weather resistant
•        Fire Retardant";s:14:"specifications";s:3:"N/A";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T02:43:35.139088+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:3;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14329;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:6:"others";s:5:"brand";s:6:"Revolt";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"HT-800";s:5:"model";s:27:"Fiber Glass Welding Blanket";s:4:"type";s:19:"Welding Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:713:"Commonly used as welding blankets and insulation linings, the HT800’s tightly woven, high tensile and high packing density satin weave pattern offers effective protection against moderate to heavy welding sparks of up to 550 °C, and intermittent sparks of higher temperature. It provides strong resistance against heat produced and reduces skin irritation caused by usual fabrics for users who are sensitive to fiber glass. Its lightweight and soft characteristics make it ideal for wrapping around all kinds of surfaces.
HT800 is used extensively in the marine, oil and gas, petrochemical, and metal construction industries to reduce the overall impact temperature and to prevent burns, fires, and explosions.";s:14:"specifications";s:27:"see specs table REVOLT.docx";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T02:43:35.139088+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:13:"Robot Systems";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:5:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15605;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:24:"robot-system-peripherals";s:5:"brand";s:13:"Robot Systems";s:12:"product_name";s:13:"Tokin Arc PBW";s:5:"model";s:20:"Portable Butt Wrlder";s:4:"type";s:29:"Arc Welding Robot Peripherals";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:534:"The Tokin Arc Portable Butt Welder (PBW) is a compact and rugged portable welding unit engineered for field and workshop butt-welding applications. Designed to weld steel wire and small components with precision and safety, it delivers adjustable welding power suitable for various wire diameters while maintaining reliable performance and ease of use. Built with safety-compliant insulation and simple controls, the PBW is ideal for mobile welding tasks and on-site repairs where dependable, portable welding capability is essential.";s:14:"specifications";s:233:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Column 1","value":"230VAC, Single Phase 50/60Hz|Electrical Power|Applicable Wire Size|Weight"},{"label":"Column 2","value":"|0.6kVA|Ø0.8~2.0mm (Solid Wire only)|13.0 kgs."}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:123:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/portable_butt_welder_20260406_061309_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:45:04.406522+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:123:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/portable_butt_welder_20260406_061309_0.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15606;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:24:"robot-system-peripherals";s:5:"brand";s:13:"Robot Systems";s:12:"product_name";s:23:"Wire Wizard NSW-BW-WS-1";s:5:"model";s:10:"Wire Sizer";s:4:"type";s:29:"Arc Welding Robot Peripherals";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:499:"The Wire Wizard Wire Sizer Model NSW-BW-WS-1 is a precision accessory for the Non-Stop® Wire Dispensing System, designed to prepare butt-welded wire ends for smooth feeding and reliable performance. It removes burrs from weld joints to ensure clean, consistent wire surfaces, eliminating snags and improving wire delivery in automated welding or high-volume production environments. This model is supplied without preset dies, allowing you to specify the correct die size for your wire application.";s:14:"specifications";s:122:"•        For solid and flux cored wire
•        Wire sizes up to .078” (2mm)
•        Replacement dies available";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:115:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/wire_sizer_1_20260406_061719_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:45:04.406522+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:115:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/wire_sizer_1_20260406_061719_0.jpg";i:1;s:115:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/wire_sizer_2_20260406_061720_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/wirewizard_nonstopwire_20260406_061720.pdf";}i:2;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15607;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:24:"robot-system-peripherals";s:5:"brand";s:13:"Robot Systems";s:12:"product_name";s:19:"AER Service EVO 2.2";s:5:"model";s:37:"Mobile Filter Unit for Welding Smokes";s:4:"type";s:29:"Arc Welding Robot Peripherals";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:654:"The EVO 2.2 is a robust mobile filtering unit designed for efficient extraction and purification of welding fumes in workshops and industrial spaces where standard ventilation isn’t feasible. Built on a powder-coated steel frame with easy-roll castors, it delivers reliable, ready-to-use performance with a high-efficiency centrifugal fan and digital control panel. Its multi-stage filtration system achieves E12 class filtration efficiency (>99.5%), capturing particulate from processes like MIG, TIG, and MMA welding. Ideal for medium-low pollutant concentrations and dry welding fumes, the EVO 2.2 keeps the air cleaner and your workspace healthier.";s:14:"specifications";s:909:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>EVO 2.2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fan capacity</td><td>2500 m3/h</td></tr><tr><td>Extraction at hood</td><td>1100 m3/h</td></tr><tr><td>Filtration efficiency</td><td>E12 &gt;99.5 %</td></tr><tr><td>Filtering area</td><td>14.5 m2</td></tr><tr><td>Motor power</td><td>1.1 – 230/50 kW – V/Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Noise</td><td>73 db [A]</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>520 x 1010 x 920 h mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>85 kgs.</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Model","EVO 2.2"],"rows":[["Fan capacity","2500 m3/h"],["Extraction at hood","1100 m3/h"],["Filtration efficiency","E12 >99.5 %"],["Filtering area","14.5 m2"],["Motor power","1.1 – 230/50 kW – V/Hz"],["Noise","73 db [A]"],["Dimension","520 x 1010 x 920 h mm"],["Weight","85 kgs."]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/evo_2.2_-_1_20260406_060128_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:45:04.406522+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/evo_2.2_-_1_20260406_060128_0.jpg";i:1;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/evo_2.2_-_2_20260406_060130_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:3;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15608;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:24:"robot-system-peripherals";s:5:"brand";s:13:"Robot Systems";s:12:"product_name";s:19:"AER Service AER 201";s:5:"model";s:42:"Portable Filtering Unit for Welding Smokes";s:4:"type";s:29:"Arc Welding Robot Peripherals";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:685:"The AER 201 is a compact, portable air filtration unit engineered for effective extraction and purification of welding fumes in enclosed or hard-to-reach areas where traditional ventilation isn’t practical. Designed for intermittent use with medium-to-low pollutant concentrations, it includes a flexible suction hose with capture nozzle and magnetic positioner for stable placement. Built with a sturdy, powder-coated steel body and a multi-stage filter system featuring a metallic spark arrestor, cartridge filter and activated carbon filter, the AER 201 delivers 99 % filtration efficiency to help maintain cleaner, healthier air during MIG, TIG, MMA and pulse welding operations.";s:14:"specifications";s:998:"{"format":"andison_specs_v3","text":"","tables":[{"tableHtml":"<table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>AER 201</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Flexible Hose</td><td>Ø 50 – L. 2000 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Fan capacity</td><td>250 m3/h</td></tr><tr><td>Extraction at hood</td><td>110 m3/h</td></tr><tr><td>Filtration efficiency</td><td>M &gt;99 %</td></tr><tr><td>Active carbons</td><td>1.5 kgs.</td></tr><tr><td>Motor power</td><td>1.1 – 230/50 kW – V/Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Noise</td><td>80 db [A]</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>530 x 270 x 450 h mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>20 kgs.</td></tr></tbody></table>","tableMatrix":{"mode":"standard","headers":["Model","AER 201"],"rows":[["Flexible Hose","Ø 50 – L. 2000 mm"],["Fan capacity","250 m3/h"],["Extraction at hood","110 m3/h"],["Filtration efficiency","M >99 %"],["Active carbons","1.5 kgs."],["Motor power","1.1 – 230/50 kW – V/Hz"],["Noise","80 db [A]"],["Dimension","530 x 270 x 450 h mm"],["Weight","20 kgs."]],"merges":[]}}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aer_201_-_1_20260406_060831_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:45:04.406522+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/aer_201_-_1_20260406_060831_0.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/datasheets/aer_201_datasheet_20260406_060832.pdf";}i:4;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:15609;s:11:"category_id";s:18:"arc-welding-robots";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:24:"robot-system-peripherals";s:5:"brand";s:13:"Robot Systems";s:12:"product_name";s:16:"Tokin Arc TKN-A1";s:5:"model";s:14:"Nozzle Cleaner";s:4:"type";s:29:"Arc Welding Robot Peripherals";s:5:"badge";s:3:"New";s:11:"description";s:857:"Tokin Arc Model TKN-A1 Nozzle Cleaner is a robot peripheral cleaning device designed to maintain welding torch nozzles by removing spatter and debris efficiently. Its simple air-driven mechanism and interchangeable cleaning heads enable effective cleaning of both the nozzle tip and inner wall without damaging components, helping extend nozzle life and reduce downtime in welding operations.

•        Pneumatic force turns the spring, allowing easy installation and safe operation.
•        It stops turning if excessive force is applied to the head during nozzle cleaning. Thus, it minimizes damage to the nozzle.
•        Numerous types of heads are available to accommodate nozzles.
•        A “regulator and solenoid valve set” type is also available.
•        A nozzle cleaner cover (spatter receptacle) is available as an option.";s:14:"specifications";s:256:"{"format":"andison_specs_v1","text":"","table":[{"label":"Column 1","value":"Air Pressure|Air Consumption|Air Connection|Outer Dimensions ( W x D x H )|Weight"},{"label":"Column 2","value":"0.2~0.5MPa|60L/min|Ø6 one-touch joint|200 x 110 x 190|1.5kgs."}]}";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/nozzle_cleaner_1_20260406_061113_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T06:45:04.406522+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/nozzle_cleaner_1_20260406_061113_0.png";i:1;s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/nozzle_cleaner_2_20260406_061114_1.png";i:2;s:119:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/nozzle_cleaner_3_20260406_061115_2.png";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:2:"SK";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:2:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14359;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"measuring-gauge";s:5:"brand";s:2:"SK";s:12:"product_name";s:8:"TPG-700A";s:5:"model";s:11:"Taper Gauge";s:4:"type";s:29:"Welding Measuring Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:1134:"The TPG-700A Taper Gauge by NIIGATA SEIKI is a high-precision measuring tool designed for checking slot widths, gaps, and internal clearances in mechanical components. Featuring a tapered profile with clearly marked graduations, this stainless-steel gauge delivers quick and accurate measurements — perfect for quality control, maintenance, and fabrication work. 

Key Features & Benefits
•        Accurate Taper-Based Measurement — Uses a tapered blade with graduated markings to measure widths from narrow gaps up to larger openings with precision. 
•        Durable Stainless Steel — Constructed from hardened stainless steel (SUS420J2) with a satin finish for rust resistance and long service life in workshop environments. 
•        Clear Graduation — 0.1 mm scale ensures easy and reliable reading for gap measurement. 
•        Compact & Portable — Lightweight and compact design makes it convenient for on-the-go use in the field or on the shop floor. 
•        Versatile Applications — Ideal for inspecting slots, grooves, clearances, and hole diameters in machinery, tooling, and quality control tasks.";s:14:"specifications";s:23:"see specs table SK.docx";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T02:44:00.307333+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14362;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"welding-accessories";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:15:"measuring-gauge";s:5:"brand";s:2:"SK";s:12:"product_name";s:4:"WG-1";s:5:"model";s:13:"Welding Gauge";s:4:"type";s:29:"Welding Measuring Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:864:"The SK Welding Gauge (WG-1) is a durable, stainless-steel inspection tool designed for efficient and accurate measurement of fillet welds and bead weld dimensions. Ideal for welding quality control in fabrication, construction, and inspection applications, this precision gauge helps ensure welds meet required standards with reliable repeatability. 

Key Features & Benefits
•	Accurate Fillet Weld Measurement — Quickly measures fillet weld throat thickness and bevel angle with reliable precision. 
•	Robust Construction — Made from high-quality stainless steel (SUS410) for long-lasting performance in shop or field environments. 
•	Portable & Easy to Use — Lightweight and compact with a handy vinyl case for storage and transport. 
•	Quality Control Tool — Helps welders and inspectors verify weld integrity and compliance with specifications.";s:14:"specifications";s:23:"see specs table SK.docx";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T02:44:00.307333+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:15:"SK And GAL GAGE";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:0:{}}s:5:"Soyer";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:5:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14325;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"arc-welding-machine";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:27:"accessories-and-consumables";s:5:"brand";s:5:"Soyer";s:12:"product_name";s:5:"PH-3N";s:5:"model";s:73:"Stud Welding Gun M3 – M12 Studs and pins with 3m highly flexible cables";s:4:"type";s:18:"Pistol Welding Gun";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:147:"The PH-3N stud welding gun is for drawn arc welding which allows different welding elements to be welded on metallic workpieces at lightning speed.";s:14:"specifications";s:3:"N/A";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:0:"";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-06T02:43:33.787737+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:17:"welding-torch-gun";s:6:"images";a:0:{}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14321;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"arc-welding-machine";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:20:"stud-welding-machine";s:5:"brand";s:5:"Soyer";s:12:"product_name";s:6:"BMS 8N";s:5:"model";s:71:"Capacitor Discharge Stud Welding Machine Welding Range : M3-M8 / M3-M10";s:4:"type";s:11:"Stud Welder";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:584:"This tried and tested type of stud welder meets the strictest requirements. It is highly performing, has a compact design and guarantees absolute safety. 
