WELDCRAFT® TIG torches are hand tools and are designed for specific TIG welding jobs, from hand-held micro TIG torches to 900 amp machines torches, there is a TIG torch model engineered for your application.

Hand-held Air-cooled TIG Welding Torches
Made from the highest quality copper alloys and are ideal for welding amperages under 250 amps. Available in one-piece and two-piece torch configurations. Weldcraft Air-Cooled Torches are excellent for portable applications as they do not require a bulky water-cooler.";s:14:"specifications";s:3:"N/A";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/tig_torch-1_20260408_025030_0.jpg";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:51:16.084214+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";s:17:"welding-torch-gun";s:6:"images";a:3:{i:0;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/tig_torch-1_20260408_025030_0.jpg";i:1;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/tig_torch-2_20260408_025031_1.jpg";i:2;s:114:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/tig_torch-3_20260408_025032_2.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}i:1;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:16813;s:11:"category_id";s:19:"arc-welding-machine";s:14:"subcategory_id";N;s:5:"brand";s:9:"Weldcraft";s:12:"product_name";s:29:"Genuine Parts and Consumables";s:5:"model";s:20:"TigTorch Consumables";s:4:"type";s:19:"Welding Consumables";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:170:"Genuine Weldcraft® TIG torch replacement parts for your air-cooled or water-cooled TIG torch. Weldcraft® TIG parts and consumables fit most major brands of TIG torches.";s:14:"specifications";s:3:"N/A";s:5:"price";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:121:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/part_consumables-1_20260408_025112_0.png";s:10:"created_at";s:32:"2026-04-08T00:51:16.084214+00:00";s:18:"sub_subcategory_id";N;s:6:"images";a:2:{i:0;s:121:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/part_consumables-1_20260408_025112_0.png";i:1;s:122:"https://ldsvzhzgyfewwprizrok.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/parts_consumables-2_20260408_025113_1.jpg";}s:9:"datasheet";s:0:"";}}}s:6:"Weller";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:8:"products";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:2:"id";i:14472;s:11:"category_id";s:11:"power-tools";s:14:"subcategory_id";s:11:"accessories";s:5:"brand";s:6:"Weller";s:12:"product_name";s:0:"";s:5:"model";s:23:"Industrial Wire Brushes";s:4:"type";s:22:"Power Tool Accessories";s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:11:"description";s:976:"Weiler’s cutting, grinding and combination wheels help metal fabrication professionals get the most demanding jobs done right, and done fast. Our high-quality line helps you select the best solution for the toughest job. Whether you are looking for serious stock removal, bevelling, grinding, notching, cutting or edge softening, Weiler will get it done or you.  Today, Weiler’s core product offering includes heavy duty wire power brushes, scratch brushes and water abrasive flap disc.

Stringer Bead Twist Wheels
•        Straight wire filaments that are twisted as a single unit like a piece of cable or wire rope.
•        Provide less flexibility and more aggressive brushing action in heavy duty applications.
•        High impact action, primarily for weld cleaning.
•        Sharp wire tips make this knot aggressive right from the start.
